SUMMARY:The Day the Chariot Moved
DESCRIPTION:There is an India hiding in plain sight\, asking us to pull the chariot. \nMindtree co-founder Subroto Bagchi returns to BIC\, where he spoke in 2006 at one of the earliest programmes\, to chart how his idea of the entrepreneur has changed across twenty years. What does “entrepreneur” mean once you meet the people who truly keep the world moving? \nAfter four decades in the corporate sector\, he answered Chief Minister Naveen Patnaik’s call to work with the Government of Odisha\, spending eight years there largely on skill development. In this talk\, he will explore a new version of the economy\, one built at the grassroots rather than in boardrooms. He will introduce the nano unicorns: ordinary people in small towns\, given training and a small grant to build what they see as necessary. He will make the case that skill development is not merely a route to employability but an instrument of human transformation. \nHis talk will be followed by a short discussion with Mekin Maheshwari\, Founder and CEO of Udhyam Learning Foundation. A Q&A with the audience will follow. \nThis talk is part of a series marking twenty years of BIC\, in which speakers and artists from the institution’s early years return to revisit the topics they first addressed. Each session traces what has changed\, what has endured\, and what to make of the same topics two decades on. \nVenue: Auditorium\n\n\nTwenty Years On: Revisiting Voices from BIC’s Founding Years\nRSVP here (https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScMVAWA6zR-xyVMB1A332Ui637F5A7waDtlhqZyJ7gz0ZZ8-A/viewform?usp=pp_url)\n*Speaker*: Subroto Bagchi\, Mekin Maheshwari\n*Event Categories*: Books\, Business\, Development\, Management\, Nonfiction\, Society\, Sustainability
URL:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/event/the-day-the-chariot-moved/
LOCATION:Bangalore International Centre\, 7\, 4th Main Road\, Domlur II Stage\, Bangalore\, Karnataka\, 560071\, India
CATEGORIES:Books,Business,Development,Management,Nonfiction,Society,Sustainability
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://bangaloreinternationalcentre.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Thumbnail_oct21.jpg
END:VEVENT
